<title>RUSSIA: Russian fund to sell 9 pct of Uralmash.</title>
<headline>Russian fund to sell 9 pct of Uralmash.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sverdlovsk Region Property Fund will offer 9.32 percent of heavy machinery builder Uralmash at an auction on April 24, the Federal Property Fund said on Monday in an advance copy of its weekly Reforma bulletin.</p>
<p>The stake amounts to 335,991 shares in OAO Uralsky Zavod Tyazhelogo Mashinostroyeniya (Uralmash), it said.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
